# Wayfarer Start - Changed text to make more sense in a sector wide setting, added new alert levels for server conditions. Check Wayfarer PR for diff view
alert-level-green = Green
# alert-level-green-announcement = It is now safe to return to your workplaces.
# alert-level-green-instructions = Do your job.
alert-level-green-announcement = The sector is now considered safe, return to operations as normal.
alert-level-green-instructions = Enjoy your day.

alert-level-blue = Blue
# alert-level-blue-announcement = There is a confirmed threat to the station. Security should perform random checks. Crewmembers are advised to be vigilant and report suspicious activity to security.
# alert-level-blue-instructions = Crewmembers are advised to be vigilant and report suspicious activity to security.
# Frontier - alert-level-blue-announcement = There is a confirmed threat to the sector. Crews are advised to be vigilant and report suspicious activity to NFSD officers.
# Frontier - alert-level-blue-instructions = Crews are advised to be vigilant and report suspicious activity to NFSD officers.
alert-level-blue-announcement = There is a confirmed sector-wide threat present in the system. Crews are advised to be vigilant and report suspicious activity to CGP officers.
alert-level-blue-instructions = Crews are advised to be vigilant and report suspicious activity to CGP officers.

alert-level-red = Red
# alert-level-red-announcement = There is an immediate threat to the station. Security should prepare to use lethal force if necessary. Crewmembers should find a safe place to shelter in, and are advised to follow any present authorities.
# alert-level-red-instructions = Crewmembers should find a safe place to shelter in, and are advised to follow any present authorities.
# Frontier - alert-level-red-announcement = There is an immediate threat to the sector. Security should prepare to use lethal force if necessary. Crews should cooperate to ensure mutual safety, and are advised to follow any present authorities.
# Frontier - alert-level-red-instructions = Crews should cooperate to ensure mutual safety, and are advised to follow any present authorities.
alert-level-red-announcement = There is an immediate sector-wide threat to the system. Peacekeeping personel should prepare to use lethal force if necessary. Crews should cooperate to ensure mutual safety, and prepare for potential hostile action. Crews are advised to follow any present authorities.
alert-level-red-instructions = Crews should cooperate to ensure mutual safety, prepare for hostile action, and are advised to follow any present authorities.

alert-level-violet = Violet
# alert-level-violet-announcement = There is a viral threat on the station. Medical staff are advised to isolate crewmembers with any symptoms. Crewmembers are advised to distance themselves from others and perform safety measures to prevent further spread.
# alert-level-violet-instructions = Crewmembers are advised to distance themselves from others and perform safety measures to prevent further spread.
# Frontier - alert-level-violet-announcement = There is a viral threat in the sector. Medical staff are advised to isolate individuals showing symptoms. Crews are advised to limit interaction with others and enforce safety measures to prevent further spread.
# Frontier - alert-level-violet-instructions = Crews are advised to limit interaction with others and enforce safety measures to prevent further spread.
alert-level-violet-announcement = There is an unidentified contagion in the sector. Medical personel are advised to isolate individuals showing symptoms and to begin investigation proceedures. Crews are advised to limit interaction with others and start safety measures to prevent further spread.
alert-level-violet-instructions = Crews are advised to limit interaction with others and start safety measures to prevent further spread. Notify medical personel if you're feeling symptomatic.

alert-level-yellow = Yellow
# alert-level-yellow-announcement = There is a structural or atmospheric threat within the station. Engineering staff are advised to immediately respond and perform safety measures. Crewmembers are advised to stay away from the threat, and stay in their workplaces if necessary.
# alert-level-yellow-instructions = Crewmembers are advised to stay away from the threat, and stay in their workplaces if necessary.
# Frontier - alert-level-yellow-announcement = Sector infrastructure has been structurally or atmospherically compromised. Engineering staff are advised to immediately respond and assist where possible. Crews are advised to stay away from the threat and cooperate with sector command.
# Frontier - alert-level-yellow-instructions = Crews are advised to stay away from the threat and cooperate with sector command.
alert-level-yellow-announcement = The sector is experiencing a natural or manmade disaster. System infrastructure may be structurally or atmospherically compromised. Engineering personel are advised to immediately respond and assist where possible. Crews are advised to proceed with caution around the disaster area and cooperate with sector command.
alert-level-yellow-instructions = Crews are advised to proceed with caution around the disaster area and cooperate with sector command.

alert-level-orange = Orange
alert-level-orange-announcement = The Concordian Weather Service has identified on RAEWS radar a severe weather system somewhere in the sector. Civil services should prepare for a potential natural disaster situation. Crews should shelter in place, and reduce travel during the weather event.
alert-level-orange-instructions = Civil services should prepare for a potential natural disaster situation. Crews should shelter in place, and reduce travel during the weather event.

alert-level-orion = Orion
alert-level-orion-announcement = The Concordian Weather Service has identified on RAEWS radar a disasterous weather system somewhere in the sector. Civil services should coordinate relief operations immediately. Crews should shelter in place, or evacuate from the path of the storm effective immediately.
alert-level-orion-instructions = Civil services should coordinate relief operations immediately. Crews should shelter in place, or evacuate from the path of the storm effective immediately.

alert-level-charon = Charon
alert-level-charon-announcement = There is an severe unidentified contagion outbreak in the sector. Medical personel are advised to isolate individuals showing symptoms immediately and to begin pandemic level quarantine proceedures. Crews are advised to take all procautions when interacting with others and enforce safety measures to prevent further spread.
alert-level-charon-instructions = Crews are advised to take all procautions when interacting with others and enforce safety measures to prevent further spread. Notify medical personel if you're feeling symptomatic.

alert-level-poseidon = Poseidon
alert-level-poseidon-announcement = The sector is experiencing a severe natural or manmade disaster. System infrastructure has failed or been catastrophically compromised. Engineering personel are advised to immediately respond and assist where possible. Crews are advised to stay away from the disaster area and cooperate with sector command.
alert-level-poseidon-instructions = Engineering personel are advised to immediately respond and assist where possible. Crews are advised to stay away from the disaster area and cooperate with sector command.

