alert-level-typhon-announcement = Central Command has identified a Typhon level disaster in the sector. Garrison forces should begin prepping for a potential catastrophic event in the sector. Civil services are to be on high alert and prepare for a potential worst case scenario. Crews should shelter in place, and prepare for a potential sector-wide disaster.
alert-level-typhon-instructions = Garrison forces should begin prepping for a potential catastrophic event in the sector. Crews should shelter in place, and prepare for a potential sector-wide disaster.

