alert-level-abaddon-announcement = Central Command has identified a Abaddon level disaster in the sector. A catastrophic event is actively occuring in the sector. Garrison forces should take defensive positions immediately and report to their stations. Civil services are to be on high alert and cooperate with Garrison and Command forces. Crews should shelter in place and cooperate with civil services.
alert-level-abaddon-instructions = Martial Law is enforced. Garrison forces should take defensive positions immediately and report to their stations. Civil services are to be on high alert and cooperate with Garrison and Command forces. Crews should shelter in place and cooperate with civil services.

