alert-level-gideon-announcement = Central Command has identified a Gideon level threat in the sector. An apocalyptic event is actively occuring in the sector. Garrison forces should take defensive positions immediately and attempt to evacuate the civilian population away from the disaster. Civil services, begin evacuation protocols. Crews should immediately follow evacuation routes and cooperate with civil service's commands.
